---
// CampusPastor.astro
// Campus pastor profile with photo, pull quote, and personal message.
// Two-column layout on desktop.
---

<section id="campus-pastor" class="bg-[#F4EFE5] py-20 md:py-28 px-6 md:px-16 animate-fade-up">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 items-start">
    <!-- Left: Photo -->
    <img
      src="/photos/DSC04891.jpg"
      alt="New Hope Church pastors"
      class="w-full md:w-auto aspect-square max-w-[420px] rounded-2xl object-cover shrink-0 shadow-[0_2px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]"
    />

    <!-- Right: Content -->
    <div class="flex-1">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-medium text-[#085CFC] mb-3">
        Our Pastors
      </p>

      <blockquote class="font-serif italic text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-[#111111] leading-snug mb-6">
        &ldquo;We&rsquo;re not building a church.<br />
        We&rsquo;re building a family.&rdquo;
      </blockquote>

      <p class="text-[#111111]/70 leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Our pastors take turns each Sunday, bringing their own voices and
        experiences to the pulpit. What they share is a love for God&rsquo;s
        word and a genuine heart for people.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#111111]/70 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Whether you&rsquo;ve been following Jesus for decades or you&rsquo;re just
        curious, there&rsquo;s a place for you here. We can&rsquo;t wait to meet you.
      </p>

      <p class="text-[#111111]/60 text-sm italic">
        Apostle Jose van Rensburg &middot; Pastor Ronald Slamet &middot; Pastor Robin van Rensburg
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
